      en: ["The lake covers 52 km².", "Maximum depth is 15 meters.", "The dam was completed in 1987.", "Annual fish catch is 1,000 tonnes.", "Lake elevation is 150 meters.", "Storage capacity is 1.1 billion cubic meters."],
